      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO NOTTHEBUTTONS (8) finished seventh of 10 as the favourite at this track two runs back when trying to lead all of the way and then again failed to fire over 1609m at this track last start when finishing eighth. He has won two of his last five runs and is worth another chance. OAKIE SMOKESHOW (4) finished fourth here last start over 1609m at this track. Racing well and in a similar line-up is worth an each-way ticket. CAPTAIN BART (2) comes here fresh-up from spell after having finished second in aa Group Two event over 2138m at Albion Park when after getting caught out wide early went forward to find the front. Should receive a soft trip in the running and rates well as a leading chance. OUR ROCKER (6) after having recorded two straight wins as the favourite in both runs failed to fire when finishing sixth of 10 over 1609m at this track last start when trying to lead all of the way. Looks well placed to return to top-three form.",
